WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 24h: Breaking through Esthar's cloaking barrier
Duration: ~21 seconds
Source: FF8 Gameplay/Cutscene
Describes the team's first glimpse of the technologically advanced hidden city of Esthar as they pass through the cloaking barrier

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The barren landscape continues. The desolate salt flats give no indication of what lies ahead.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The party approaches an invisible threshold. A shimmer in the air ripples outward — the cloaking barrier of Esthar becomes momentarily visible, like heat haze distorting the atmosphere.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
As the party steps through the barrier, the world transforms. Behind them remains the desolate wasteland. Ahead, the hidden city of Esthar is suddenly revealed in full majesty.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Towering structures of gleaming white and silver stretch toward the sky. The architecture is futuristic — curved, elegant, and impossible. Massive buildings with transparent walls and glowing accents reflect light. The city is impossibly clean and bright.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Hovering vehicles float silently between buildings. Elevated highways in the form of transparent tubes carry traffic high above the ground. Blue and silver energy pulses through the infrastructure. The city stretches to the horizon, defying the gray desolation that surrounds it.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The party stands at the threshold, looking in awe at this technologically advanced civilization — a stark contrast to everything they've seen before.
